{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:04:07+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul Delivery Chapter", "steam_appid": 1451990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Soul delivery is a narrative platformer focused on exploration, story, and interaction. This is a cozy game for every sci-fi story fan that doesn't require you to be especially reactive. Your choices will affect the story.<br><br>The story takes place in a neon city in the future. You wake up as a work unit robot, without knowing who you are and what is going on, you are assigned to a mission right away: delivering an anonymous package to a mysterious robot. As you venture out into the night, the story about humans and AI behind this world starts to unfold.<br><br><br>FEATURES:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Talk to robots with dynamic options to explore the story of this mysterious world. Make choices that affect the story.<br></li><li>Solve puzzles to advance the story.<br></li><li>Enjoy beautiful 2D graphics generated from 3D models with dynamic lighting.<br></li><li>Upload your consciousness to different bodies.<br></li><li>No violence(except for the last boss).<br></li><li>This game doesn't require you to be especially reactive(except for the last boss, but it won't be hard even if you are not good at action games).</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "Soul delivery is a narrative platformer focused on exploration, story, and interaction. This is a cozy game for every sci-fi story fan that doesn't require you to be especially reactive. Your choices will affect the story.<br><br>The story takes place in a neon city in the future. You wake up as a work unit robot, without knowing who you are and what is going on, you are assigned to a mission right away: delivering an anonymous package to a mysterious robot. As you venture out into the night, the story about humans and AI behind this world starts to unfold.<br><br><br>FEATURES:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Talk to robots with dynamic options to explore the story of this mysterious world. Make choices that affect the story.<br></li><li>Solve puzzles to advance the story.<br></li><li>Enjoy beautiful 2D graphics generated from 3D models with dynamic lighting.<br></li><li>Upload your consciousness to different bodies.<br></li><li>No violence(except for the last boss).<br></li><li>This game doesn't require you to be especially reactive(except for the last boss, but it won't be hard even if you are not good at action games).</li></ul>", "short_description": "A robot with amnesia ventures through the night of a neon city without humans in search of what happened between humans and AI.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451990/header.jpg?t=1727504047", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727504047", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727504047", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 9.0 Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li